WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:04.862
Create a room for the sample study group.

00:00:04.862 --> 00:00:09.767
Hold replies for teacher approval.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:18.696
Make a limited learner invitation.

00:00:18.696 --> 00:00:24.273
Read what the room shares before joining.

00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:29.662
Join through the learner invitation.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:36.289
Send guidance visible only to teachers.

00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:43.196
Ask Keating a question from the learner profile.

00:00:43.196 --> 00:00:47.492
Approve the held reply.

00:00:47.492 --> 00:00:51.563
The learner sees the approved reply.

